Z||000006||Kelvin Vivian||04-15-2001||11:47 PM||||It's great to hear stories such as these, to know that there are others not of this forum  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> who appreciate Fieros...<P>Spring has arrived, it's time to insure and shine these cars up and drive them among the Z3s, the S2000s, Miatas, MR-Spyders, Boxter's, and even the Corvettes!!!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1601741&a=12208700&p=44402874&Sequence=1&res=high">  <BR>88 GT, 5-spd<BR>87 SE 4-cyl, 5-spd||||reg||14
